<TD ALIGN="left" VALIGN="top"> <P ALIGN="left" STYLE=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt">Adjusted net incomei of $1.1&nbsp;million and $8.7&nbsp;million for the three and twelve months ended
December&nbsp;31, 2024, decreases of 81% for the 3 months&#146; period and 7% for the twelve months&#146; period compared to the 2023 equivalent periods. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
<TABLE STYLE="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Times New Roman; font-size:10pt" BORDER="0" CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%">
