$0.04&nbsp;million respectively. The increase is mainly attributed to a higher amount of funds placed under time deposits. </P></TD></TR></TABLE> <P STYLE="font-size:6pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&nbsp;</P>
